<title>FRANCE: FRENCH COURT RULES AGAINST RENAULT ON CLOSURE.</title>
<headline>FRENCH COURT RULES AGAINST RENAULT ON CLOSURE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>A French court on Friday barred French automaker Renault SA from carrying out the procedure to close the Vilvoorde plant in Belgium until it fulfilled legal obligations to consult its European works council.</p>
</text>
